WEBVTT

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:45.708
Wh-Who are you?

00:00:54.417 --> 00:00:55.792
Charge!

00:00:55.792 --> 00:00:57.625
Kick their ass!

00:01:00.625 --> 00:01:02.083
Wh-What are you...

00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.750
You aren't on our side?

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.125
Who is that group of soldiers?

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.583
That's...

00:02:46.042 --> 00:02:50.042
"Ray of Light"

00:02:51.708 --> 00:02:55.208
Dude, that's awesome!

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:57.417
That's gross!

00:03:43.792 --> 00:03:46.292
I can't collapse now.

00:03:58.125 --> 00:03:59.417
Alice?

00:03:59.417 --> 00:04:04.167
Don't overdo it, Asuna.
Leave the rest to us, the Integrity Knights.

00:04:04.167 --> 00:04:08.833
But those red soldiers are from the real world.

00:04:08.833 --> 00:04:11.500
They're enemies who came from my world.

00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:20.000
Even so, if they're merely a bloodthirsty lot,
haphazardly flailing their swords,

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.042
there's nothing to fear
even if there are thousands of them.

00:04:22.042 --> 00:04:24.000
Exactly!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:27.625
How about sharing a little bit of the glory?

00:04:35.958 --> 00:04:39.250
Everyone. Thank you.

00:04:41.042 --> 00:04:42.792
All right!

00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:48.292
All troops, form a phalanx!
We're going for a single-point breakthrough!

00:05:10.708 --> 00:05:17.250
I-I have to inform the emperor
that we're aborting the mission.

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:43.875
Ch-Champion!

00:05:59.583 --> 00:06:01.917
Ch-Champ...

00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:15.125
The emperor didn't give us any orders
regarding those red soldiers.

00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:16.625
Isn't that right?

00:06:16.625 --> 00:06:18.917
Yes, that's correct, but...

00:06:18.917 --> 00:06:25.375
Then if we were to slaughter them,
it would have nothing to do with the emperor.

00:06:25.375 --> 00:06:27.083
Champion.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:33.542
Listen. Once a bridge goes up over the valley,
charge in with the entire army.

00:06:33.542 --> 00:06:36.750
Whatever it takes, you have to rescue
our people on the other side!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.958
Huh? Bridge? How--

00:06:38.958 --> 00:06:40.583
It's obvious.

00:06:41.958 --> 00:06:44.458
Ask someone who can do it.

00:06:50.208 --> 00:06:53.125
If I can't cross the ropes...

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:57.875
...then I'll just have to jump it myself!

00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:10.000
Champion!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.750
Damn it!

00:07:59.042 --> 00:08:00.375
Stop.

00:08:01.625 --> 00:08:03.125
Stop.

00:08:04.167 --> 00:08:06.375
Stop!

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.708
Take this!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.500
They're all weak.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.542
A person from the Dark Territory?

00:09:01.708 --> 00:09:03.375
Amazing.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:06.750
Let's make a deal.

00:09:06.750 --> 00:09:08.375
Deal?

00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:15.083
Yes. You're the one who made those fissures
and that giant chasm, right?

00:09:15.083 --> 00:09:15.917
Yes.

00:09:15.917 --> 00:09:20.708
Listen. Put a bridge across the crack behind
me. It can be narrow, as long as it's sturdy.

00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:23.958
Do that, and my 4,000 pugilists
will fight with you

00:09:23.958 --> 00:09:27.833
until we annihilate every one
of those red soldiers.

00:09:27.833 --> 00:09:32.667
The Dark Territory Army will fight with us?

00:09:32.667 --> 00:09:36.042
I don't think this man would lie.

00:09:41.667 --> 00:09:43.542
All right.

00:09:43.542 --> 00:09:45.917
I'll build a bridge over the chasm.

00:10:29.292 --> 00:10:30.792
They're...

00:10:30.792 --> 00:10:32.542
...anomalies!

00:10:34.333 --> 00:10:36.125
Move.

00:10:36.125 --> 00:10:38.042
Move!

00:10:46.042 --> 00:10:47.917
System Call.

00:10:50.375 --> 00:10:52.000
Discharge!

00:10:56.208 --> 00:10:59.708
I'll incinerate them all at once
from the top of that hill!

00:10:59.708 --> 00:11:01.083
Move!

00:11:01.083 --> 00:11:03.208
Little one, don't run off by...

00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:13.000
Little one!

00:11:14.875 --> 00:11:16.375
Enhance Arma...

00:11:21.792 --> 00:11:25.458
You bastard!
What are you doing to my apprentice?

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.042
Get out of the way!

00:11:31.042 --> 00:11:33.250
Release Recollection!

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:39.208
Knight Commander, please go!

00:11:39.208 --> 00:11:41.750
Sorry! I'll leave the rest to you!

00:11:54.125 --> 00:11:55.625
Go!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.250
Amazing.

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.000
Being impressed isn't going to cut it.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:38.958
If we do make it south,
what are we going to do then?

00:12:38.958 --> 00:12:44.042
Defeating that many enemies
might be difficult, even for us.

00:12:44.042 --> 00:12:46.250
When you break through the enemy lines
and make it south,

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:50.250
keep advancing,
and distance yourselves from the enemy.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:54.625
I'll create another fissure
and isolate the enemy.

00:12:54.625 --> 00:12:57.375
A message! A message!

00:12:57.375 --> 00:13:01.875
Integrity Knight Alice has been carried away
by the enemy commander on his dragon!

00:13:01.875 --> 00:13:04.708
The dragon seems to have flown to the south.

00:13:04.708 --> 00:13:05.375
Wh...

00:13:05.375 --> 00:13:09.125
Did you say the emperor flew away?

00:13:09.125 --> 00:13:12.042
So he wasn't just looking on
as a spectator earlier?

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:13.375
Hey, woman!

00:13:13.375 --> 00:13:15.875
Alice is the Priestess of Light, isn't she?

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:18.875
Why does the emperor want her so badly?

00:13:18.875 --> 00:13:24.208
What's going to happen
if the emperor captures the Priestess of Light?

00:13:24.208 --> 00:13:28.250
This world will be destroyed.

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:32.208
When the Dark God Vecta seizes Alice,
the Priestess of Light,

00:13:32.208 --> 00:13:34.250
and reaches the World End's Altar,

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:37.375
this world, both the Human Empire
and the Dark Territory,

00:13:37.375 --> 00:13:39.625
will be returned to nothingness.

00:13:44.083 --> 00:13:47.083
Dragons can't fly forever.

00:13:47.083 --> 00:13:50.333
The most they can fly
without a break is half a day.

00:13:51.375 --> 00:13:54.833
Then it looks like you'll have to put
your spirit into it and give chase, right?

00:13:54.833 --> 00:13:58.500
"Give chase"? But you...

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:02.833
Aren't you with the Dark Territory Army?
Why would you say that?

00:14:02.833 --> 00:14:08.417
Emperor Vecta told us, the council of ten,
in so many words,

00:14:08.417 --> 00:14:12.042
that all he was after
was the Priestess of Light.

00:14:12.042 --> 00:14:16.917
The moment he flew away with the priestess,
the emperor's goal was achieved.

00:14:16.917 --> 00:14:18.208
In other words,

00:14:18.208 --> 00:14:21.375
whatever we do now,

00:14:21.375 --> 00:14:27.250
even if it's helping the Human Empire Army
steal back the priestess from the emperor,

00:14:27.250 --> 00:14:30.125
it's our choice.

00:14:30.125 --> 00:14:31.875
Isn't that right?

00:14:33.167 --> 00:14:38.667
I... We... can't defy the emperor directly.

00:14:38.667 --> 00:14:43.250
If the emperor gives us another order
to fight all of you,

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.125
we have to obey.

00:14:45.125 --> 00:14:49.542
So we, the pugilists guild,
will stop the red soldiers here.

00:14:49.542 --> 00:14:52.958
I want you and the Human Empire Army
to go after the emperor.

00:14:52.958 --> 00:14:59.417
And then tell the emperor... that bastard...

00:14:59.417 --> 00:15:01.708
Let that bastard know!

00:15:01.708 --> 00:15:05.292
That we're not his damned puppets!

00:15:08.167 --> 00:15:10.167
All right!

00:15:10.167 --> 00:15:14.792
Everyone! Hold that breach!

00:15:15.833 --> 00:15:20.625
And you two get out of here.
We can only hold out for so long.

00:15:20.625 --> 00:15:21.875
Thank you.

00:15:21.875 --> 00:15:24.792
I will remain here, too.

00:15:24.792 --> 00:15:27.958
Understood. Please take care of the rearguard.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.542
Are you sure about this, woman?

00:15:36.542 --> 00:15:39.250
I already told you my name.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:43.667
Are you sure about this, Sheyta? There's
no guarantee that you'll live through this.

00:15:43.667 --> 00:15:45.833
I'll be the one to slash you.

00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:48.542
They can't have you.

00:15:48.542 --> 00:15:50.167
Whatever!

00:15:52.667 --> 00:15:56.792
All right! Come on, everyone,
show me some fire!

00:15:58.167 --> 00:15:59.500
Circular formation!

00:15:59.500 --> 00:16:01.250
All-around defense!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:06.250
Any morons that come near us, give them hell!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:08.750
You're fired up, huh, Champion?

00:16:11.458 --> 00:16:13.042
Yeah!

00:16:13.042 --> 00:16:15.458
"Tuesday, July 7, 2026 6:01 AM Ocean Turtle"

00:16:21.667 --> 00:16:24.750
Oh, hey! You're awake, huh?

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:27.750
I figured your brain cells got fried up.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.667
Shut up.

00:16:29.667 --> 00:16:31.083
That's right.

00:16:31.083 --> 00:16:35.125
I fell into a bottomless hole, and...

00:16:35.125 --> 00:16:38.042
How exactly did you die over there?

00:16:38.042 --> 00:16:41.000
You've been out for eight hours!

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.208
E-Eight hours?

00:16:44.208 --> 00:16:47.208
Don't be so surprised.

00:16:47.208 --> 00:16:53.583
Don't worry. At the time of your death in
there, the acceleration rate went down to 1:1.

00:16:53.583 --> 00:16:55.792
D-Did you say 1:1?

00:16:55.792 --> 00:16:58.750
Hey! You know what that means,
right, Four Eyes?

00:16:59.667 --> 00:17:04.208
Twelve hours from now,
the JSDF command is going to attack this place.

00:17:04.208 --> 00:17:05.917
Yeah I know.

00:17:05.917 --> 00:17:09.792
These are all Captain Miller's orders.

00:17:09.792 --> 00:17:16.042
Right now, I'm sending U.S. players into
the Dark Territory via a satellite connection.

00:17:16.042 --> 00:17:17.833
What?

00:17:20.875 --> 00:17:24.250
This is the movement log
for you and the captain.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:28.542
Right now, the captain's gone past where
you died, and is heading further south.

00:17:28.542 --> 00:17:33.625
And he's left behind the entire Dark Territory
forces in the north. He's going solo.

00:17:33.625 --> 00:17:35.917
What that means is...

00:17:35.917 --> 00:17:40.917
He's either chasing Alice,
or has already captured her, huh?

00:17:40.917 --> 00:17:46.500
Yeah, but there's one problem. Look at this.

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.917
What's marked in red
is the horde of U.S. players.

00:17:49.917 --> 00:17:54.667
And the black part surrounded by the red
is the Dark Territory Army.

00:17:54.667 --> 00:17:59.583
The problem is this white group here,
or what's barely left of it, that is.

00:17:59.583 --> 00:18:02.750
That's the Human Empire Army.
There're at least 700 of them.

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:05.917
If they catch up to the captain,
it's going to be a pain.

00:18:05.917 --> 00:18:08.125
I have to stop them somehow.

00:18:08.125 --> 00:18:11.625
Stop them, sure, but how?

00:18:13.208 --> 00:18:17.417
These are the U.S. players
waiting for the second connection.

00:18:17.417 --> 00:18:21.292
Once it hits 20,000, I'm going to flood
the Human Empire Army's position with them.

00:18:21.292 --> 00:18:25.500
That's 28 times the combat power.
They'll be crushed instantly!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:28.583
And then I'll set the acceleration
rate back to 1,000:1.

00:18:28.583 --> 00:18:31.625
That should give the captain plenty of time

00:18:31.625 --> 00:18:36.458
to capture Alice and reach
the southernmost system console.

00:18:36.458 --> 00:18:39.500
I hope it'll go that smoothly.

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:42.833
The Human Empire Army
is tougher than you think.

00:18:42.833 --> 00:18:46.542
Those Integrity Knights are especially insane.

00:18:46.542 --> 00:18:50.708
They did mow down the entire
first wave of the Dark Territory Army.

00:18:50.708 --> 00:18:55.458
Otherwise, I never would've been
defeated in such a... shameful...

00:18:57.292 --> 00:18:58.958
Lightning Flash.

00:18:58.958 --> 00:19:01.208
That's right! There's no mistaking it.

00:19:01.208 --> 00:19:03.500
It was definitely that woman!

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:06.167
Huh? What are you saying?

00:19:06.167 --> 00:19:08.042
Hey, you stupid geek!

00:19:08.042 --> 00:19:13.875
Those Rath guys holed up in the second control
room are doing the same thing as us!

00:19:13.875 --> 00:19:18.792
There's a Japanese VRMMO player
mixed in with the Human Empire Army!

00:19:18.792 --> 00:19:19.583
What?

00:19:19.583 --> 00:19:25.125
If Lightning Flash Asuna is there,
that could mean that he did a dive, too.

00:19:25.125 --> 00:19:28.333
Are you serious?
I can't just sit here like this!

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:31.083
Hey! I'm going back in!

00:19:31.083 --> 00:19:35.125
Send me to the white group's location
at the same time as the 20,000 reinforcements.

00:19:35.125 --> 00:19:40.583
Even if you want to go back, there's no dark
knight account anymore since you wasted it.

00:19:40.583 --> 00:19:44.333
If you're okay with one of the reinforcement's
grunt account, I have plenty of those.

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:49.167
I have an account. A real special one!

00:20:32.708 --> 00:20:34.500
I leave the rest in your hands.

00:20:39.833 --> 00:20:43.292
Oh no. Sir Renly is sacrificing himself
to break through.

00:20:43.292 --> 00:20:44.542
Don't!

00:21:23.042 --> 00:21:24.625
It can't shoot rapid-fire?

00:21:24.625 --> 00:21:26.208
That's fine.

00:21:26.208 --> 00:21:29.583
Single-shot weapons
are more fitting for me, anyway.

00:21:46.333 --> 00:21:49.000
Sorry to keep you waiting, Asuna.

00:21:56.458 --> 00:21:58.208
Shino-non!

00:23:48.333 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "The Great Underworld War."
